If you mean the contents of the system identification register, under OpenVMS 
you can do it with a DCL command like this:

WRITE SYS$OUTPUT SYSID=F$GETSYI("SID")

If enter HELP LEXICALS at the DCL prompt you will be able to get info on many 
other items as well as those available through F$GETSYI.





