You can announce/publish at anytime you want. SPEC requires a 
full disclosure of the results containing the information that 
goes into the newsletter when the announcement is made. There 
is no requirement that results be submitted to the newsletter.
Another requirement is that results can only be reported for 
H/W and S/W that will ship within a 6 month window. If you are 
not willing or ready to provide a full disclosure or commit to 
a 6 month availabity deadline, only estimates are allowed.

