>
>Am I typing in the wrong command (perhaps rz(0,1,2)ultrix is incorrect)?

Ultrix calls its kernels /vmunix.  Try that same command & substitute
"vmunix" for "ultrix"

>As a side note, has anyone installed pmax with out the use of a helper
>machine? This machine is at home, and the only other CPU I have there is
>a Mac, and I doubt that could be used as a helper machine.

Having more than one disk drive should be enough, but you'll have very
little margin for error.  A better place to ask for help on this would
be the NetBSD project's port-pmax mailing list.  To subscribe, send
mail to majordomo@netbsd.org containing the line 
subscribe port-pmax

