Fred> What configuration file should I modify on Dec Alpha to
Fred> authorize any user to log as root from a terminal.
See man pages for securettys and group.  Add the comma-separated list
of allowed users to the end of the `system' entry in /etc/groups.  To
allow them to do this at any terminal (other than console), add `ptys'
to /etc/securettys.

